- Runs: a sentence under five words stands once a reply at most; any further one joins its neighbour with a comma or conjunction, a nervous card's stalls, cut-off lines and one-word answers aside; long paragraphs and jokes stay as they are.}}{{/if}}{{setvar::ariaPatchJoins::}}{{setvar::ariaVoiceExtra::; one raw thought each, in their own voice, steering their next move}}
